# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
*.local

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store

# Rust / Tauri (once the app lands)
src-tauri/target/
src-tauri/gen/

# Local
.claude/

# Clips are ignored by default and un-ignored per language, which fails safe:
# a language nobody has decided about stays out.
#
# Recorded ones are committed — a contributor's own voice, given deliberately,
# and the app is not much use without them.
#
# Synthesised ones are not. `make clips` renders with Apple's system voices and
# whether that output may be redistributed is unanswered; clips/README.md has
# the detail. clips/ja is that case today.
clips/*/*.wav
!clips/en/*.wav
